{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0113AJ2b3JcyBw8WVyDrH7u5","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"wanted\": {\n    \"kind\": \"mqtt-broker\",\n    \"listen\": [\n      \"lan\",\n      \"tailnet\"\n    ],\n    \"port\": 1883,\n    \"notes\": \"Broker MQTT unique du Pi. Clients hors Docker : 2 ESP8266 sur le LAN (192.168.1.98 = pc-power, 192.168.1.78 = fan) avec 192.168.1.101:1883 en dur, sans auth. Topic retenu critique : bureau/fan/speed/set (dernière consigne) ; status online/offline retenus avec last-will. LEGACY : docker compose dans /home/amonot/mosquitto (conteneur mqtt_broker, eclipse-mosquitto:2.1-alpine, port 1883 sur 0.0.0.0, volume nommé mosquitto_mosquitto_data = messages retenus, conf allow_anonymous + persistence). Migration autorisée : migrer la persistance, arrêter l ancien dans la même minute, vérifier la reconnexion des ESP (docker logs) et le message retenu (mosquitto_sub --retained-only).\"\n  },\n  \"users\": [\n    \"fan-controller\",\n    \"pc-power-controller\"\n  ],\n  \"containers\": [],\n  \"alias_ok\": false,\n  \"listening\": [\n    \"0.0.0.0:1883\",\n    \"[::]:1883\"\n  ],\n  \"listen_wanted\": [\n    \"192.168.1.101:1883\",\n    \"100.72.6.43:1883\"\n  ],\n  \"on_all_interfaces\": true,\n  \"tcp_clients\": 0,\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"dir\": \"/srv/infra/shared/mqtt\",\n    \"state\": \"/srv/shared/mqtt\"\n  }\n}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d73e16f6-88fe-4412-b498-d190de2c9300","uuid":"b5832334-a544-48b0-b764-620e3da53ffc","timestamp":"2026-10-25T15:33:19.594Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"wanted\": {\n    \"kind\": \"mqtt-broker\",\n    \"listen\": [\n      \"lan\",\n      \"tailnet\"\n    ],\n    \"port\": 1883,\n    \"notes\": \"Broker MQTT unique du Pi. Clients hors Docker : 2 ESP8266 sur le LAN (192.168.1.98 = pc-power, 192.168.1.78 = fan) avec 192.168.1.101:1883 en dur, sans auth. Topic retenu critique : bureau/fan/speed/set (dernière consigne) ; status online/offline retenus avec last-will. LEGACY : docker compose dans /home/amonot/mosquitto (conteneur mqtt_broker, eclipse-mosquitto:2.1-alpine, port 1883 sur 0.0.0.0, volume nommé mosquitto_mosquitto_data = messages retenus, conf allow_anonymous + persistence). Migration autorisée : migrer la persistance, arrêter l ancien dans la même minute, vérifier la reconnexion des ESP (docker logs) et le message retenu (mosquitto_sub --retained-only).\"\n  },\n  \"users\": [\n    \"fan-controller\",\n    \"pc-power-controller\"\n  ],\n  \"containers\": [],\n  \"alias_ok\": false,\n  \"listening\": [\n    \"0.0.0.0:1883\",\n    \"[::]:1883\"\n  ],\n  \"listen_wanted\": [\n    \"192.168.1.101:1883\",\n    \"100.72.6.43:1883\"\n  ],\n  \"on_all_interfaces\": true,\n  \"tcp_clients\": 0,\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"dir\": \"/srv/infra/shared/mqtt\",\n    \"state\": \"/srv/shared/mqtt\"\n  }\n}"}],"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"infra","version":""}}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0113AJ2b3JcyBw8WVyDrH7u5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
